<% layout("partials/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">

            <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

            <p class="text-muted">
                Last updated: September 2, 2026
            </p>

            <p>
                Welcome to Wanderlust. This Privacy Policy explains how
                information is collected, used, and protected when you use
                our website.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h3>

            <p>
                When you create an account or use certain features of
                Wanderlust, we may collect information such as your username,
                email address, listing information, reviews, and other
                information you voluntarily provide.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">2. How We Use Information</h3>

            <p>
                We use collected information to provide and improve our
                services, authenticate users, manage listings and reviews,
                communicate with users, and maintain the security of the
                application.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">3. Account Information</h3>

            <p>
                Users are responsible for keeping their account credentials
                secure. Please contact us if you believe your account has
                been accessed without authorization.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">4. Cookies and Sessions</h3>

            <p>
                Wanderlust may use sessions and cookies to maintain user
                authentication and provide essential functionality.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">5. Third-Party Services</h3>

            <p>
                Wanderlust may use third-party services such as MongoDB,
                Cloudinary, Mapbox, and email service providers to operate
                different parts of the application.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">6. Data Security</h3>

            <p>
                We take reasonable measures to protect information stored
                within the application. However, no online service can
                guarantee complete security.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">7. Changes to This Policy</h3>

            <p>
                This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.
                Changes will be reflected on this page.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">8. Contact</h3>

            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please
                contact the Wanderlust project administrator.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>